#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:10
msgid "Bounded framing, time and byte sessions"
msgstr "有界分帧、时间与字节会话"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:12
msgid ""
"These optional C11 mechanisms consume explicit bytes or the existing byte-"
"stream face. The application supplies storage, a serialized executor, "
"protocol policy and any finite deadlines. They create no UART/socket owner, "
"worker, device scan or automatic command replay."
msgstr ""
"这些可选 C11 机制消费显式字节或已有 byte-stream face。应用提供存储、串行 executor、协议策略及所需有限 "
"deadline；它们不创建 UART／socket owner、worker、设备扫描或自动命令 replay。"

