#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:0
msgid ""
"One command over a caller-supplied `nx_byte_stream_t`, text/URC and explicit"
" binary lengths"
msgstr "调用者提供的 `nx_byte_stream_t` 上的一条命令、text／URC 和显式 binary 长度"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:24
msgid "Retain frame and response boundaries"
msgstr "保留 frame 与 response 边界"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:26
msgid ""
"COBS supplies message boundaries, without integrity or authentication. Its "
"incremental decoder discards overflow until a delimiter. Once ready, its "
"frame view borrows the decoder buffer until release; feed returns BUSY "
"without consuming a byte. Preserve that byte or stop reading upstream. If "
"integrity is required, validate the product-selected CRC before dispatching "
"the payload."
msgstr ""
"COBS 提供消息边界，不提供完整性或认证。增量 decoder 在 overflow 后丢弃输入直到 delimiter。ready 后，frame "
"view 借用 decoder buffer 直到 release；feed 返回 BUSY "
"且不消费字节。须保留该字节或暂停上游读取。需要完整性时，先验证产品选定的 CRC，再分发 payload。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:32
msgid ""
"ATClient copies an admitted command into caller TX storage, then service "
"advances partial stream writes and reads under the original absolute "
"deadline and explicit call budget. Response, URC and binary callback views "
"expire when the callback returns. Binary lengths come from reviewed module-"
"specific responses; there is no assumed module or prompt grammar. A timeout,"
" malformed line or stream failure can desynchronize the session after real "
"command effects. Recover software parsing only after the product "
"reestablishes the actual module boundary and joins transport users; never "
"blindly replay the command."
msgstr ""
"ATClient 将已准入 command 复制到调用者 TX 存储，再由 service 按原绝对 deadline 和显式调用预算推进 "
"partial stream write／read。Response、URC 和 binary callback view 在 callback "
"返回后失效。binary 长度来自已审模块特定 response，不假定模块或 prompt 语法。timeout、畸形行或 stream 失败可能在 "
"command 已产生实际效果后使会话失同步。只有产品重新建立模块真实边界并 join transport 使用者后，才恢复软件解析；不得盲目 "
"replay command。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:41
msgid "Separate local transfer from product update policy"
msgstr "区分本地传输与产品更新策略"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:43
msgid ""
"XMODEM validates sequence, complement and CRC before each bounded 128-byte "
"write callback. A repeated previous block is acknowledged without writing it"
" again. The caller copies emitted control bytes into its own TX state, "
"supplies same-domain time to feed/poll, and enforces the finite session and "
"packet budgets. BUSY with a pending control byte does not consume new input."
msgstr ""
"XMODEM 在每次有界 128-byte write callback 前验证序号、反码和 CRC。重复的上一 block 仅 "
"ACK，不再次写入。调用者将输出 control byte 复制到自己的 TX 状态，为 feed／poll 提供同域时间，并执行有限 "
"session／packet 预算。有 pending control byte 时，BUSY 不消费新输入。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:49
msgid ""
"Every callback receives 128 bytes including sender padding. Product length, "
"manifest, authorization, staging and signature/version checks determine "
"usable content and whether an update may proceed. Accepted blocks are not "
"rolled back by cancellation or failure. This profile has no checksum "
"fallback, 1 KiB blocks, YMODEM filename handling, Flash partition selection "
"or reboot policy."
msgstr ""
"每次 callback 收到含发送方 padding 的 128 字节。产品 length、manifest、授权、staging "
"和签名／版本检查确定有效内容及是否允许更新。取消或失败不回滚已接纳 block。此 profile 无 checksum fallback、1 KiB "
"block、YMODEM 文件名、Flash partition 选择或 reboot 策略。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:55
msgid "Keep UTC quality separate from monotonic deadlines"
msgstr "区分 UTC 质量与单调 deadline"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:57
msgid ""
"WallClock does not modify Core time or scheduler deadlines. It combines an "
"explicit UTC sample with its monotonic observation, validity interval and "
"stated oscillator-drift bound. Ordinary SNTP results remain MEASURED; the "
"product must review a source before asserting TRUSTED. A parse result cannot"
" bypass TLS's trusted-time requirement."
msgstr ""
"WallClock 不修改 Core 时间或 scheduler deadline。它将显式 UTC 样本与其单调观测、有效期及声明的 "
"oscillator drift 上界组合。普通 SNTP 结果保持 MEASURED，产品须审查来源后才能声明 TRUSTED。解析结果不能绕过 "
"TLS 的可信时间要求。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:63
msgid ""
"The product validates the response source IP/port, original unpredictable "
"request token and unique outstanding request, and explicitly selects NTP era"
" 0 or 1. Uncertainty includes local RTT and server delay/dispersion, without"
" proving network symmetry, source honesty or physical timestamp accuracy. "
"Invalid, expired or discontinuous time must not become a fabricated usable "
"UTC value."
msgstr ""
"产品验证 response source IP／port、原始不可预测 request token 及唯一 outstanding "
"request，并显式选择 NTP era 0 或 1。不确定度包含本地往返时延（RTT）和 server "
"delay／dispersion，不证明网络对称、来源诚实或物理 timestamp 准确。无效、到期或不连续时间不得变成伪造的可用 UTC 值。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/protocols/streams.md:69
msgid ""
"Join callbacks and release borrowed views before resetting or reclaiming "
"session storage, then close the lower transport under its own contract. "
"Software protocol results do not establish physical serial/network timing or"
" device qualification; hardware HIL remains `not_executed`. CANopen and "
"additional exact device profiles remain `not_selected`."
msgstr ""
"reset 或回收 session 存储前，join callback 并释放借用 view，再按下层 transport "
"自身合同关闭。软件协议结果不建立物理串口／网络时序或器件资格；硬件 HIL 保持 `not_executed`。CANopen 与其他精确器件 "
"profile 保持 `not_selected`。"

